  m_text: "Hope your shifts going smoothly. I just wanted to remind you its important
    to take your scheduled moments to step away from your station when you can. I
    know the supervisors prefer everyone to stay focused, but a little time to interact
    with the outside can do wonders for morale.\nRemember, they say the light outside
    helps you see things more clearly. You should \"interact\" with it sometime.\n\nStay
    well,\n\u2014Obrien"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
