  m_text: 'Yo! I just wanted to slide some quick tips since you''re new here.


    The
    code to the cabinet lock should be 0000. The old geezer who had it before would
    always forget it otherwise.


    Also, don''t take too much time on break. The
    company might say you have a lot, but if you use it all they''ll start pressing
    you.


    // Friendly Neighbourhood Co-worker'
